    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2011-06-22/11-10#art_122> ;
    dznorm:position 0 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2011-06-22/11-10#art_122_condition_0_092155dd_action_32e0e6882f> a dznorm:Action ;
