    dznorm:expressedIn <https://legal.dz/resource/law/2011-06-22/11-10#art_45> ;
    dznorm:position 0 .

<https://legal.dz/resource/law/2011-06-22/11-10#art_45_obligation_0_872c4e29> a dznorm:Obligation ;
